# In-game pause menu (Escape, when saving is possible): the box window itself is a 480 x 500 dialog centred on a 40%
# scrim, the game logo on top and the commands as a column of menu buttons, in the original order. Units: 1 = frame
# height / 1080.
scrim
window $QuitMenuParent centre middle 0 0 480 500 dialog
window $WinLoad left top 758 314 404 110
stack centre top 0 448 440 14
  item $ButtonSaveLoad 52 menu
  item $ButtonOptions 52 menu
  item $ButtonRestart 52 menu
  item $ButtonExit 52 menu
  item $ButtonReturn 52 menu
end
